# The evidence SQLite store is the working store, not the committed artifact
# (D-04). What is committed is the deterministic text export in
# state/evidence/*.jsonl, which this pattern does not match.
state/*.db
state/*.db-wal
state/*.db-shm

# Planning artifacts live in the working repo, not in the published one.
.planning/

# Agent tooling configuration, not project documentation. Nothing a verifier
# needs, and it is the clearest authorship tell in the tree.
CLAUDE.md

# The append-only observation log is the local working record. It carries
# superseded schema-1 rows whose wording predates the current spec, and the
# committed public evidence is state/evidence/*.jsonl plus the record
# published beside each coin page -- both regenerated from the current code.
state/observations.jsonl
